+\frac{i\epsilon^3}{3!}H^3+\cdots.$ 在二阶，哈密顿量作用两次。这就是第一批复合过程图像的代数起源。

p.src:
This extra two-valued degree of freedom resembles spin algebraically, but in one dimension it is not ordinary angular momentum. Define $\alpha=
\begin{pmatrix}
1&0\\
0&-1
\end{pmatrix}
=\sigma_3.$ Its $+1$ eigenvector selects the right-moving component and its $-1$ eigenvector the left-moving component. In the massless theory, the Hamiltonian is simply $H=\alpha p,$ and the two equations combine into $i\partial_t\Psi=-i\alpha\partial_x\Psi.$

